    <string name="storm_help_dialog_title">Storm Mode Guide</string>
    <string name="storm_help_dialog_message">"&lt;b&gt;Variable Storm&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Turns on automatic cycles that alternate calm periods and storm bursts. While active, it locks the manual clouds, wind, rain and lightning controls because it varies them on its own.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Global Brightness&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Adjusts the base lighting level of the whole scene and clouds. Lower settings make the ambient night dark and dramatic, brilliantly illuminated when lightning strikes.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Clouds and Wind&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Controls how many clouds appear, their movement speed (dynamics), and wind direction/intensity. Wind also drives the visible wind lines and affects the falling angle of the rain.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Rain&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Sets how intense and fast the rain falls, its color, whether it spawns from the clouds or from the screen edges, and the size of the droplets that splash on the screen glass itself.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Lightning&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Adjusts lightning frequency and duration, its color, whether it strikes from clouds or edges, and whether it produces glow flashes on the clouds or lights up the whole screen.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Background&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Picks the image or color shown behind the storm scene (landscape, plain black, or a custom photo). This background is the canvas the clouds, rain and lightning are drawn over."</string>
    <string name="sunny_help_dialog_title">Day and Night Mode Guide</string>
    <string name="sunny_help_dialog_message">"&lt;b&gt;Time Mode&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Choose whether the background shows only Day, only Night, a Combined cycle that alternates between both, or the real-time Clock (uses your device's time). This choice determines which other sections are active.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Environment Setting&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Controls the daytime cloud density, the landscape background (or minimalist silhouette/your own image) and the 3D gyroscope tilt effect.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sun Settings&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Sets the sun's size and pulse, the sky color theme (customizable gradient), the sun's path and movement speed, and the god rays.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Moon and Stars Settings&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Adjusts the moon phase, the night sky's brightness/stars and the background nebula (intensity and color).&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Combined&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Only applies in Combined or Clock mode: sets the day/night cycle speed and the shared path of the sun and moon as they alternate."</string>
